Working Girl is a 1988 American romantic comedy drama film directed by Mike Nichols, written by
Kevin Wade, and starring Harrison Ford, Sigourney Weaver, and Melanie Griffith.

11
00:59:42,857 --> 00:59:48,857
Its plot follows an ambitious secretary from Staten
Island working in mergers and acquisitions.

12
